{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n//日本思夢樂推出「竹輪保暖腿套」\n</p>\n<p>日本思夢樂（しまむら）聯乘食品品牌「紀文」推出招牌竹輪為靈感的「竹輪保暖腿套」及「竹輪保暖襪套」！將竹輪的經典外觀完整還原，無論是竹輪表面的紋理，還是烤製後的焦黃色澤，都細緻重現。商品消息一出隨即在社群平台引發熱烈討論。不少網友直呼「怎麼辦，好想要！」，認為這款商品既實用又充滿趣味，非常適合作為秋冬季的保暖單品，甚至有人表示要買來送給朋友當作搞笑禮物。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179526962751025650_15647552036b01a3fc194e6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179526962751025650_15647552036b01a3fc194e6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179526962980881288_20236569516b01a3fe46c0b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179526962980881288_20236569516b01a3fe46c0b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DgAI5saE7-Q/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T14:25:46.483583+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":278,"images":2,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T14:00:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T16:07:24.113930+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T14:18:07.220282+00:00","content_hash":"f89d42592dad71bb822d3a0f1a1f05b5ccaa16d716da1ecd613110ea2a5be42c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}